category: Science
build-depends: cygport autoconf-archive hdf5 libhdf5-devel libyaml-cpp-devel python312-cython python312-matplotlib python312-numpy python3-devel zlib-devel
sdesc: "Yet more Objects for Data Analysis (licensing & readmes)"
ldesc: "YODA is a small set of data analysis (specifically histogramming) classes
being developed by MCnet members as a lightweight common system for MC event
generator validation analyses, particularly as the core histogramming system
in Rivet."
